{
  "title": "Taweez against All Tumors",
  "data": "For any swelling of the body, recite the last four verses of [Surah al-Hashr](A63) (59:21-24) with reflection, while you are in a state of ritual purity, after you have performed the ritual ablution (wudu) for an obligatory prayer, both before and after the prayer. The verses begin:\nلَوْ اَنْزَلْنَا هٰذَا الْقُرْاٰنَ عَلٰى جَبَلٍ\nLAW ANZALNAA HAADHAL QUR'AANA A'LAA JABAL\nHad We sent down this Qur'an on a mountain...\nThese four verses are given in full in [Taweez against Warts](I46). The swelling will then vanish, Allah willing."
}
